	"Description": "Unreal MCP Server v5.0.0 (beta) for Unreal Engine 5.8: MCP 2025-06-18 over HTTP with scoped permissions and session-owned state, editor surface capture and observers, deterministic Blueprint/UMG/animation/material/Niagara/sound/PCG validation, typed widget and Blueprint patches with revisions, snapshots and world-bound references, tick-driven PIE scenarios and owned operations, non-blocking external generation, telemetry and diagnostic bundles. Tool reference and validation evidence ship in docs/. Beta: see docs/validation/RELEASE_STATUS.md for proven versus open items.",
